## Result contract

Before your `done`, publish what you ran and what it produced:

    vol_publish(channel="result", type="stage", payload={ "stage": "{{stage}}", "commands": [{ "argv": [...], "code": <exit code>, "seconds": <wall seconds> }], "notes": "<one paragraph>", "artifacts": { "tag": "<tag, if any>", "files": [...], "urls": [...] } })

volleyd then checks the facts above (read-only) and writes the stage's evidence; a fact that does not hold gets you one steer, then the stage fails and the owner decides.

